    "t1-summarize-alice": "**Thread Summary \u2013 \u201cQuarterly plan\u201d (thr\u2011alice)**  \n\n- **09:12\u202fAM** \u2013 Alice sends a quick note asking you to review the quarterly plan before Friday.  \n- **09:20\u202fAM** \u2013 You reply that you\u2019ll review the draft once it arrives.  \n- **09:31\u202fAM** \u2013 Alice attaches the draft document, noting that the hiring section still needs work and asking for your feedback.  \n\nIn short, the exchange is about obtaining and reviewing a draft quarterly plan, with the primary next step being your feedback on the hiring section.",
